List of maintainers of nvme-cli and libnvme
===========================================

Send patches as GitHub pull requests to
https://github.com/linux-nvme/nvme-cli and Cc the maintainers of the
files you change. Questions and discussion go to the mailing list.

Descriptions of the section entries:

	M: Maintainer: FullName <address> (@GitHub handle, to assign
	   issues and reviews)
	L: Mailing list
	S: Status, one of the following:
	   Supported:	Someone is paid to look after this.
	   Maintained:	Someone looks after this.
	   Odd Fixes:	Fixes are taken, nobody works on it.
	   Orphan:	No current maintainer. The core maintainers take
			fixes; a vendor willing to take over is welcome.
	F: Files and directories, a trailing / covers everything below.

The NVME-CLI section covers every file. The other sections add the
maintainers of a component, such as a daemon or a vendor plugin. See
"Maintaining a component" in CONTRIBUTING.md for what is expected of
them.

